{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-82","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-82-talk-403815802-line","text":"「我尝试复制黑塔女士的奇物。」它说，「别问我是谁，这只是我的虚拟形象。给你些宝贝…不过和普通的奇物不太一样。你得先付出代价，才能有收获。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-82-talk-403815803-line","text":"你要接受吗？","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-82-text-5366500740738402783-choice","text":"接受奇物:「有机心脏」。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-82-text-7610944183572952065-choice","text":"接受奇物:「神秘」磁力。","speaker":""}]}
